odpacks/lightcraftprojectlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Lite version-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=quora&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_installation.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XP0u6PytMrk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/How_to_Install-Watch_on_YouTube-red?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube\" alt=\"Generated button\" width=\"310\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252flightcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth Download-CLICK-green?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"28\"></strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Почему стоит выбрать&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\">Light Craft</span> вместо <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">OptiFine</span> и <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">других модпаков</span>?</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">» Этот модпак <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">гораздо</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">&nbsp;быстрее</span></s